Package: doltliter
Type: Package
Title: A 'DBI' Backend for 'DoltLite' Version-Controlled 'SQLite'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cathal", "Byrne", email = "cathal470@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Embeds 'DoltLite' <https://github.com/dolthub/doltlite>, a fork of
    'SQLite' whose storage engine is a content-addressed prolly tree, and
    exposes it as a conformant 'DBI' backend. Standard 'DBI' verbs behave as
    they do for any 'SQLite' database, while Git-style version control --
    commits, branches, diffs, merges, tags and remotes -- is available through
    ordinary R functions. Works with 'dplyr' and 'dbplyr' through the 'DBI'
    interface.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CathalByrneGit/doltliter
BugReports: https://github.com/CathalByrneGit/doltliter/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: DBI (>= 1.1.0), methods, bit64
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), DBItest (>= 1.7.0), blob, dbplyr, dplyr,
    knitr, rmarkdown, withr, RSQLite
LinkingTo:
SystemRequirements: A C++11 compiler, zlib. Either a prebuilt 'libdoltlite'
    (found via pkg-config or DOLTLITE_HOME), a vendored 'DoltLite'
    amalgamation staged by tools/vendor_amalgamation.R, or network access at
    install time to download a prebuilt library. See INSTALL.
NeedsCompilation: yes
Biarch: true
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Collate:
    '00-classes.R'
    'zzz.R'
    'Doltlite-driver.R'
    'Doltlite-connection.R'
    'Doltlite-result.R'
    'dolt-sql.R'
    'dolt-commit.R'
    'dolt-branch.R'
    'dolt-history.R'
    'dolt-remote.R'
    'dbplyr.R'
    'reexports.R'
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
